{"id":"memorial_104604","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial104600","label":"Memoirs · Neatly Written Record"},"label":"Record 4: A Great Discovery!","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_104603","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_104604_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_46_04_description","text":"I've made an incredible discovery."},{"id":"memorial_104604_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_46_04_description","text":"It's... a new and wondrous phenomenon I never could have foreseen."},{"id":"memorial_104604_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_46_04_description","text":"Inside Whaley, I found a new life."},{"id":"memorial_104604_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_46_04_description","text":"This child is neither human, nor Nikke, nor even a Rapture."},{"id":"memorial_104604_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_46_04_description","text":"Could it be a new species?"},{"id":"memorial_104604_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_46_04_description","text":"Or perhaps a new evolution of the Raptures, born to make peace with humanity?"},{"id":"memorial_104604_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_46_04_description","text":"What new chapter in human history will this great discovery herald?"}]}